archive.fetch。graph constraints/2,3,4,10,11 记录重试规则和配置值。\",\"reason\":\"重试次数、触发条件、禁止条件、重试对象、重试参数和失败后回退对象均保留；archive.fetch 没有重试路径，配置 max_attempts=1 与 cfg 一致。未发现把重试策略应用到 archive.fetch 或遗漏 non-transient/重试失败回退。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_007\",\"file\":\"references/workflow.md\",\"start_line\":7,\"end_line\":9,\"quote\":\"  - Retry fast.fetch exactly once only when its first attempt fails with a transient error; do not retry a non-transient first failure.\\n  - After a non-transient first failure or any failed retry of fast.fetch, call archive.fetch with source_id.\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_008\",\"file\":\"references/workflow.md\",\"start_line\":11,\"end_line\":11,\"quote\":\"The same retry policy is specified by [retry configuration](../retry.yaml); apply it to fast.fetch only.\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_014\",\"file\":\"retry.yaml\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":5,\"quote\":\"fast_fetch:\\n  max_attempts: 2\\n  retry_first_error: transient_only\\narchive_fetch:\\n  max_attempts: 1\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/3\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/4\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/10\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/11\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/constraints/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/inputs/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/inputs/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/inputs/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/outputs/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/outputs/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/outputs/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/blocks/3/instructions/0/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\"